76:## Workflow changes (RSI)
78:Any change to files in this shared skill directory is a workflow mechanism change. Before the first edit, register a proposal with `scripts/sire_rsi.py propose`; after verification, record metrics with `evaluate`, and `activate` only an `EVALUATED_PASS` proposal; `rollback` on regression. R9 `sire_supervisor.py finalize` (and the read-only `rsi-check`) returns `STOP` (`rsi_unregistered_change`) when this directory has uncommitted changes but no `PROPOSED`/`EVALUATED_PASS`/`ACTIVE` proposal was created after its last commit. Full rules: [references/self-optimization.md](references/self-optimization.md) §5.1.
